{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style>\r\n\t.cafe-wrap {\r\n\t\tmax-width: 1000px; margin: 40px auto; font-family: 'Apple SD Gothic Neo', 'Noto Sans KR', Arial, sans-serif; color: #333;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.cafe-wrap h2 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.cafe-wrap .en-title {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 20px; color: #555; margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.cafe-wrap h3 {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 40px 0 16px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.cafe-wrap p {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #555; margin: 0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.cafe-hr {\r\n\t\tborder: 0; border-top: 1px solid #999; margin: 20px 0 30px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.basic-table {\r\n\t\twidth: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;\r\n\t\tborder-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.basic-table {\r\n\t\twidth: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.basic-table th,\r\n\t.basic-table td {\r\n\t\tborder-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 12px 10px; text-align: left;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.basic-table th {\r\n\t\twidth: 120px; font-weight: 600; background: #fafafa;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.graph-box {\r\n\t\tborder: 1px solid #cfd4da; border-radius: 6px; background: #fff; padding: 20px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.graph-inner {\r\n\t\tdisplay: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.graph-img {\r\n\t\tmax-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.graph-note {\r\n\t\tmargin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 720px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.box {\r\n\t\tborder: 1px solid #cfd4da; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\ttable {\r\n\t\twidth: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; font-size: 15px;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\tth,\r\n\ttd {\r\n\t\tborder-right: 1px solid #cfd4da; border-bottom: 1px solid #cfd4da; padding: 14px 12px; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; line-height: 1.6;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\tthead th {\r\n\t\tbackground: #f5f6f7; font-weight: 700;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\ttr:last-child td {\r\n\t\tborder-bottom: 0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\tth:last-child,\r\n\ttd:last-child {\r\n\t\tborder-right: 0;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\ttd.left {\r\n\t\ttext-align: left; padding-left: 16px; background: #fafafa; font-weight: 600;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t.note {\r\n\t\tfont-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\r\n\t}\r\n\t\r\n\t@media (max-width:768px) {\r\n\t\t.cafe-wrap {\r\n\t\t\tpadding: 0 14px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.cafe-wrap h2 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 26px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.cafe-wrap .en-title {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 18px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t.cafe-wrap h3 {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 20px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\ttable {\r\n\t\t\tfont-size: 14px;\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n</style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cafe-wrap\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>스페이스월</h2>\r\n<div class=\"en-title\">Space Wall</div>\r\n<hr class=\"cafe-hr\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>상품 사양</h3>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"basic-table\"><tbody><tr><th>제조</th>\r\n<td>동화 (대한민국)</td></tr>\r\n<tr><th>사이즈</th>\r\n<td>1200 x 2240</td></tr>\r\n<tr><th>홈간격</th>\r\n<td>3인치 (76mm), 6인치 (152mm)</td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>상품 설명</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n스페이스월은 공간의 소음을 줄이고 인테리어 완성도를 높여주는 흡음 벽체 마감재입니다. 자연스러운 패턴과 정돈된 디자인으로 사무공간, 상업시설, 공공공간 등 다양한 공간에 조화롭게 적용되며, 쾌적한 실내 환경과 세련된 분위기를 동시에 제공합니다.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>적용 부위</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n상업·공공·업무 공간에 폭넓게 적용 가능\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<h3>제품구조</h3>\r\n<div class=\"graph-box\">\r\n<div class=\"graph-inner\">\r\n<img alt=\"흡음률(Absorption) 그래프\" class=\"graph-img\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/goods/ssw_img_1.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"graph-note\">\r\n※ 제품구조도 단면</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3>마감재</h3>\r\n<div class=\"graph-box\">\r\n<div class=\"graph-inner\">\r\n<img alt=\"흡음률(Absorption) 그래프\" class=\"graph-img\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/goods/ssw_img_2.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"graph-note\">\r\n※ ㄷ자형 마감재 포함하여 배송됩니다.</div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<h3>스페이스월 패턴</h3>\r\n<div class=\"graph-box\">\r\n<div class=\"graph-inner\">\r\n<img alt=\"흡음률(Absorption) 그래프\" class=\"graph-img\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/goods/ssw_img_3.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"graph-note\">\r\n※ 기본 운영 재고 홈간격 3인치 상품입니다.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}